---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/global/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/global/Footer.astro';
import Container from '../../components/global/Container.astro';
import Section from '../../components/global/Section.astro';
import TechnicalLabel from '../../components/global/TechnicalLabel.astro';
import Button from '../../components/global/Button.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Oppstar × AionSi | Engineering Capacity Alignment" description="A focused engineering alignment page for Oppstar covering potential collaboration across RTL, Design Verification, Physical Design, DFT, SoC integration and engineering automation.">
  <Header />
  <main>
    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-14 md:py-20 lg:py-24">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.08fr_.72fr] lg:items-center">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>OPPSTAR × AIONSI · ENGINEERING CAPACITY ALIGNMENT</TechnicalLabel>
            <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-5xl text-5xl font-semibold leading-[1.02] tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-7xl">Engineering capacity for complex semiconductor programs.</h1>
            <p class="mt-7 max-w-3xl text-xl leading-9 text-slate-600 md:text-2xl">Complement an established semiconductor engineering organization with focused AionSi teams aligned to defined work packages, milestones and technical ownership.</p>
            <div class="mt-9 flex flex-wrap gap-4">
              <Button href="/contact">Discuss an Engineering Requirement</Button>
              <a href="/capabilities" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-slate-300 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] transition hover:border-[var(--aionsi-blue)]">Explore Capabilities</a>
            </div>
            <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-500">AionSi management team in Malaysia · 20 September–5 October 2026</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-7 shadow-sm">
            <TechnicalLabel>PARTNERSHIP MODEL</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-4 text-2xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Add execution capacity without disrupting the core team.</h2>
            <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">Start with a defined engineering requirement and scale the team only when the program demonstrates the need.</p>
            <div class="mt-7 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Defined scope</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Technical ownership</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Milestone driven</div>
              <div class="border border-slate-200 p-4">Scalable teams</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:items-start">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>WHY THIS CONVERSATION</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Complement depth, don't duplicate it.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-8 text-slate-600">
            <p>Oppstar has built a broad semiconductor engineering organization spanning ASIC/SoC design and delivery. AionSi is not approaching this as a generic outsourcing proposal.</p>
            <p>The discussion is about whether a specific workstream, specialist requirement or schedule-sensitive program could benefit from an additional engineering team operating against agreed scope, milestones and technical interfaces.</p>
            <p class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Potential alignment should be established through the engineering requirement—not assumed in advance.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-white py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <TechnicalLabel>ENGINEERING ALIGNMENT</TechnicalLabel>
        <p class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-base leading-7 text-slate-600">Potential areas where AionSi can complement an existing semiconductor engineering organization.</p>
        <div class="mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">01 · FRONT END</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">RTL & SoC Integration</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">RTL development, IP integration and subsystem-level engineering around defined design work packages.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">02 · VERIFICATION</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Design Verification</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">UVM, IP/subsystem/SoC verification, regressions, debug and coverage-closure support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">03 · BACK END</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Physical Design</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Synthesis, STA, physical implementation, timing closure, ECO and signoff-oriented execution.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">04 · TEST</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">DFT</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Scan, ATPG, memory test and DFT implementation or closure support around defined scope.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">05 · SYSTEM</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">System & Embedded</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">FPGA prototyping, firmware, drivers, board bring-up and system integration support.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-7">
            <div class="text-xs tracking-[.18em] text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">06 · PRODUCTIVITY</div>
            <h3 class="mt-4 text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Engineering Automation</h3>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Flow automation and AI-assisted engineering productivity around customer methodologies and workflows.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-surface-alt)] py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.78fr_1.22fr] lg:items-start">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>WHERE ENGINEERING LEVERAGE CAN START</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">Start small. Prove execution. Scale with the roadmap.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Parallel execution</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Add capacity around a defined work package while the core team retains program ownership.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Specialist capacity</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Bring focused capability to a technical area where additional bandwidth is required.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Schedule support</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Create a dedicated execution lane around a milestone or closure target.</p></div>
            <div class="border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Scale after validation</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Expand from a focused team to dedicated engineering capacity when the working model is proven.</p></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[.75fr_1.25fr]">
          <div>
            <TechnicalLabel>DELIVERY MODEL</TechnicalLabel>
            <h2 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-[var(--aionsi-navy)] md:text-5xl">From requirement to delivered work package.</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="grid gap-3">
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr] gap-5 border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">01</div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Understand</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Clarify program objective, technical constraints and bottleneck.</p></div></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr] gap-5 border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">02</div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Define</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Agree scope, skills, tools, milestones, deliverables and ownership.</p></div></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr] gap-5 border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">03</div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Build</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Assign the right engineering capability and technical ownership.</p></div></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr] gap-5 border-b border-slate-200 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">04</div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Execute</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Deliver against agreed milestones, quality gates and engineering KPIs.</p></div></div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[64px_1fr] gap-5 py-5"><div class="text-sm font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-orange)]">05</div><div><h3 class="font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Validate & Handoff</h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Close deliverables, review acceptance criteria and transition ownership.</p></div></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="py-12 md:py-18">
      <Container>
        <TechnicalLabel>ENGAGEMENT OPTIONS</TechnicalLabel>
        <div class="mt-5 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Project Engineering</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">AionSi owns a defined engineering work package.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Extended Engineering</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Add specialist capacity to an existing team.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Dedicated Team</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Build a focused team around a longer-running program.</p></div>
          <div class="border border-slate-200 p-6"><h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-[var(--aionsi-navy)]">Engineering ODC</h3><p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600">Create scalable offshore engineering capacity aligned to the roadmap.</p></div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>

    <Section class="bg-[var(--aionsi-deep-navy)] py-14 text-white md:py-20">
      <Container>
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
          <TechnicalLabel>MEET IN MALAYSIA</TechnicalLabel>
          <h2 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight md:text-6xl">A 30-minute engineering discussion at your office.</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-8 text-white/70">Our management team will be in Malaysia from 20 September to 5 October 2026. We would welcome a practical discussion around your roadmap, engineering requirements and potential areas of alignment.</p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4"><Button href="/contact">Request a Meeting</Button><a href="mailto:info@aionsi.com" class="inline-flex items-center justify-center border border-white/30 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:border-white">Email AionSi</a></div>
        </div>
      </Container>
    </Section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
